<h2><strong>Position Summary:&nbsp;</strong></h2>
<p>We are looking for an Enterprise Account Executive, reporting to the VP of Global GTM. We are seeking an elite, high-performing <strong>Enterprise Account Executive</strong> to drive new business acquisition across top-tier accounts. Combining large-enterprise sophistication with an aggressive, entrepreneurial hunting mindset, you will architect transformational security deals, engage C-level stakeholders, and position <strong>business resilience</strong> for the world's most mission-critical ERP environments.</p>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<h3><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Drive Strategic Revenue:</strong> Own the full sales lifecycle for Global 2000 accounts, positioning the Onapsis Platform as the essential security layer for SAP and Business Critical Applications.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><strong>The SAP "Triple Threat":</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Direct Sales:</strong> Manage complex, high-value "land and expand" cycles.</li>
<li><strong>SAP Co-Sell:</strong> Partner with SAP Account Executives (AEs) and Enterprise Architects&nbsp; to attach Onapsis to S/4HANA and RISE migrations.</li>
<li><strong>GSI Alignment:</strong> Orchestrate go-to-market strategies with Global Systems Integrators (Accenture, Deloitte, IBM, PwC) who are leading the world's largest SAP transformations.</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><strong>C-Suite Advisory:</strong> Act as a trusted advisor to CISOs and CIOs, translating technical vulnerabilities into business risks (e.g., SOX compliance, financial downtime, and data integrity).</p>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Territory Orchestration:</strong> Develop and execute an annual territory plan focused on "White Space" analysis within the SAP installed base.</p>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Forecast Accuracy:</strong> Maintain a high level of "Sales Hygiene" within CRM, delivering predictable weekly and monthly forecasts aligned with SAP's rigorous reporting standards.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3><strong>Required Skills/Experience:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<ul>
