hip of their scope, and who proactively address issues before anyone asks.<br /><br /></p><h1><strong>Your Skills &amp; Experience:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are hiring multiple engineers of varying levels, so please indicate your years of experience on the application form to apply for the appropriate position.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of professional experience building consumer-facing web products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep expertise in React / Next.js, TypeScript and Node.js.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of web performance: rendering strategies (SSR, edge, static), caching, CDNs, Core Web Vitals, and how mobile and in-app browsers behave.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with deep linking, Universal Links / App Links and attribution. Experience with App Clips is a big plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience designing analytics taxonomies and running experiments, and real care for data quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A growth mindset: you think in funnels and conversion rates, and you love moving a metric.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong product and visual taste. You notice the 2px misalignment and the 100ms delay.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working autonomously across frontend and backend. Knowledge of infrastructure (Bazel, GCP, Kubernetes) is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion and experience building consumer-facing products. We’d love to hear about things you’ve shipped!<br /><br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>AI as a multiplier</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is part of how we build every day. We’re looking for engineers with a real grasp of these tools, who use them to multiply their output and not to make up for missing expertise. You should be able to drive an agent through a complex change, judge what it produc