n English and French, German as an advantage.</p><p>Your Contact:</p><p>Mr. Ivano Coni would like to support you. Your application will be kept strictly confidential.</p><p></p><p>coni + partner ag</p><p>Ivano Coni</p><p>Managing Director</p><p>Klosbachstrasse 107</p><p>CH-8032 Zürich</p><p>Tel.: +41 44 254 90 10</p><p></p><p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/conipartner-ag/associate-operational-risk-geneva-323131","tags":["Compliance","Security"],"job_types":["Indefinite contract (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","entry"],"location":"Geneva","created_at":1792821641},{"slug":"legal-counsel-zurich-111759","company_name":"BLP Digital AG","title":"Legal Counsel","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Join BLP and help make the world’s business processes autonomous! </strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our agentic platform helps finance and operations teams worldwide remove manual work from their core business processes, so work runs end-to-end with greater control and significant productivity gains. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, over 550 enterprise customers use BLP across 1,300+ deployed projects. In the processes we automate, customers achieve productivity improvements of 5 to 10 times. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">To date, BLP remains majority employee-owned, with Goldman Sachs holding a minority stake as a growth investor. Our success is driven by deep expertise in technology and business processes, a superior product with strong product-market fit, reflected in an expanding customer base that includes Fortune 500 companies. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">BLP is one of Switzerland's fastest-growing SaaS scale-ups; we are now entering our next phase of growth. From our headquarters on Zürich's Bahnhofstrasse, we're expanding globally, with a growing presence across Europe and North America. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Join us and help make autonomous operations the new standard. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are BLP's first in-house lawyer. You build the legal function from scratch and protect a business that puts agentic AI into the ERP processes of 550+ enterprise customers. You report to the CFO and partner closely with Sales, Finance, People and Product, covering four entities in Switzerland, Germany, the UK and the US, with customers in 40+ countries. In your first 12 months, Sales runs on your contract playbook and standard templates, and BLP has a clear compliance framework for data protection and AI regulation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Own commercial contracting end-to-end: negotiate customer MSAs, DPAs and SLAs with enterprise procurement and legal teams, so deals close faster with risk you can explain to the CFO.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Build the legal toolkit: templates, a negotiation playbook with fallback positions and clear approval rules, so Sales can handle standard deals without escalating to you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Lead data protection and AI compliance across GDPR, the Swiss FADP and the EU AI Act, and support security reviews and certifications, so enterprise customers trust how we handle their data.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Run corporate housekeeping for BLP Digital AG and its subsidiaries in Germany, the UK and the US: board and shareholder matters and cap table</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Advise on employment law across our countries and protect our IP and trademarks, working with the People team on contracts, policies and equity plans.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Select and manage external counsel, deciding what stays in-house and what goes out.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You bring 7+ years of legal experience, including at least 3 years in-house at a B2B SaaS or tech company, ideally after training at a leading law firm.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You are admitted to the bar in Switzerland or another European jurisdiction and are comfortable advising on Swiss, EU, UK and US matters with appropriate external support.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You have personally negotiated enterprise SaaS contracts with large corporate customers and closed them on terms the business could live with.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You have hands-on GDPR and data protection experience and follow the EU AI Act closely.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You have built something from zero before: a template library, a contract process or a legal function, and you are happy to be the only lawyer in the room.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You are pragmatic and commercial in your approach. You give clear, risk-weighted advice in plain language, at the speed of a fast-growing company, in fluent English and German language.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong plus</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Experience with venture financing rounds, ESOP setups and/or M&amp;A.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Background in ERP, finance automation or AI products.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Experience with ISO 27001 or SOC 2 audits from the legal side.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll get</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Founding ownership. You shape BLP's legal function from day one and decide how it scales.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Direct line to leadership. You report directly to the CFO and work with the leadership team on decisions that matter.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Global scope. Four entities, 40+ countries and enterprise customers give you breadth few in-house roles offer.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You work at the front line of AI regulation, applied to real enterprise processes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You grow with the company and are set up to build and lead a team as legal needs expand.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· You work from our headquarters on Zürich's Bahnhofstrasse, with a team that values Impact, Transparency, Ownership and Excellence.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">· Competitive package. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />Learn more about BLP and our values at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://blp.digital/company/careers"><u>blp.digital/company/careers</u></a>.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/blp-digital-ag/legal-counsel-zurich-111759","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Zurich","created_at":1792820425},{"slug":"strategic-account-executive-zurich-198851","company_name":"Benchling","title":"Strategic Account Executive (Zurich)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are rebuilding biotech for the AI era.<br /><br />When a breakthrough is delayed, the world waits. Getting a molecule from discovery to patients, or a crop from lab to field, involves thousands of slow, manual, disconnected steps. AI has the potential to change this, compressing decades of R&amp;D work into years. But that only happens when clean, structured scientific data and AI are built into how science gets done.<br /><br />Benchling is the AI platform for biotech R&amp;D. Scientists use Benchling to design experiments, capture structured data, and run AI agents and models directly in their workflows. Over 200,000 scientists around the world trust Benchling to power their most important work, from academic labs to Sanofi, Moderna, and more than half of the world's top 50 biopharma.<br /><br />We’re building an AI scientist for our customers. We can’t do that if we haven’t built the muscle ourselves. AI fluency is the foundation we build on; it's core to how we work, and we're committed to helping every new hire integrate it into their day-to-day. As part of our interview process, you'll complete a brief AI-focused exercise or discussion so we can understand how you think about and use AI to drive impact in your role. Feel free to reference any tools, platforms, or workflows you use today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>ROLE OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are seeking a motivated and results-driven Strategic Account Executive to join our team. In this role, you will be responsible for driving new business within your territory, focusing on building and maintaining strong relationships with key stakeholders across various personas within an account. You will play a crucial role in expanding our customer base and ensuring successful sales outcomes through effective pipeline generation and accurate sales forecasting.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"> </p><h2><strong>RESPONSIBILITIES</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pipeline Generation:</strong>  Creating 80% of your pipeline by identifying new business opportunities and engaging with multiple personas within the prospect/customer base. Utilize various strategies and tools to generate leads and move them through the sales cycle.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sales Forecasting:</strong> Develop and maintain accurate sales forecasts (+/- 10 of goal), leveraging data to inform decision-making and ensure predictable revenue outcomes with the goal of consistent attainment of revenue targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Solution Selling:</strong> Effectively communicate the value of our platform, tailoring presentations and proposals to meet the specific needs of each prospect.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Negotiation and Closing:</strong> Lead negotiations with potential clients, by thoughtfully addressing key stakeholders including multiple personas and CxO in the buyer journey, while navigating organizational complexities, addressing objections and securing new business agreements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Account Management:</strong> Work across multiple personas within an account to understand their unique needs and align Benchling’s solutions with their business objectives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Partner with internal teams (marketing, product, customer success, etc) and Channel to ensure a seamless experience for clients and drive long-term customer satisfaction.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Continuous Learning:</strong> Stay informed about industry trends, competitors, and emerging technologies to maintain a competitive edge in the market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Process:</strong> Drive the sales process through Pipeline Generation (PG), 3 Why’s, Champion Building, MEDDICC, Command of the Message, etc.  Maintain account integrity and opportunity data within company systems; Salesforce.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2><strong>QUALIFICATIONS</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are drawn to our mission and you want to help Benchling win new business. You are committed to working in a collaborative environment, working together as a team. You have a love for working in a fast-paced environment and taking the initiative to get stuff done and try new things. You are passionate about powering new possibilities in biotech faster.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience as an Account Executive, preferably within a data management, workflow SaaS or technology-driven environment that sells to multiple personas across IT &amp; Line of business.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to drive pipeline generation and manage complex sales cycles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong sales forecasting skills with a track record of meeting or exceeding targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated success in selling products or solutions that typically fall outside of pre-established budgets, with a proven ability to build a compelling business case and influence purchasing decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with diverse personas within an account (from technical decision makers, business decision makers &amp; CxO execs), with the ability to influence decision-making at all the levels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dynamic communication, negotiation, and interpersonal skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Self-motivated, with a strong drive to achieve and exceed goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively in a team environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with MEDDICC sales methodology is a plus but not required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Knowledge of the life sciences industry, including: R&amp;D, and/or IT functions is preferred but not required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bachelor’s degree - life sciences major is preferred but not required.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>HOW WE WORK</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer a flexible hybrid work arrangement that prioritizes in-office collaboration. Employees are expected to be on-site 3 days per week (Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">#LI-Hybrid #LI-Remote</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">#BI-Hybrid #BI-Remote</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Benchling welcomes everyone.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe diversity enriches our team so we hire people with a wide range of identities, backgrounds, and experiences. <br /><br />We are an equal opportunity employer. That means we don’t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law, including but not limited to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/benchling/strategic-account-executive-zurich-198851","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Zurich, Switzerland","created_at":1792820424},{"slug":"senior-internal-auditor-front-office-compliance-crossborder-zurich-8384","company_name":"coni+partner AG","title":"Senior Internal Auditor / Front Office Compliance, Crossborder","description":"<p>coni + partner ist ein seit 1993 bestehendes Beratungshaus mit Sitz in Zürich und Niederlassungen in Düsseldorf und Shanghai. Unsere Stärke ist die passgenaue Besetzung von Positionen entsprechend der Unternehmenskultur, unter genauer Betrachtung fachlicher Kompetenzen, Referenzen und «soft skills» der Kandidaten.</p><p>Unser Kunde ist eine Bank in Zürich. Wir suchen einen auf Compliance-Themen spezialisierten Revisor (m, w, d) als </p><p><strong>Senior Internal Auditor / Front Office Compliance, Crossborder</strong></p><p>Ihre Aufgaben:</p><p>Selbstständige Prüfung von Compliance- und Risikomanagement-Themen wie Anti-Money Laundering, Investment Suitability und Crossborder liegen / Verantwortlich für Prüfungen mit risikoorientiertem, systematischen Ansatz und Best-Practice-Fokus / Mitarbeit bei Spezialabklärungen und Projekten / Präsentation und Besprechung der Prüfungsergebnisse vor dem Head of Internal Audit im Rahmen / Verantwortlich für das Schaffen von Risikobewusstsein durch das Challengen des Linien-Managements / Support bei der Optimierung interner Prozesse / Verfassen griffiger Berichte / Beratung von Linienmanagern sowie internen und externen Stakeholdern/ Verantwortlich die Umsetzung der empfohlenen Massnahmen / Überwachung der Optimierungen bis zur Implementation / Mitarbeit bei der Entwicklung und Gestaltung des Jahresprüfplans / Mitwirkung bei der Weiterentwicklung und Gestaltung von Prüfungsinstrumenten und –methodiken. </p><p>Ihr Profil:</p><p>Master, Bachelor oder Ph.D. / CPA (Wirtschaftsprüfer), ACCA oder CIA, CISA oder CFA / Senior-Persönlichkeit / Erfahrung mit der Leitung von Audits im internationalen Umfeld / Fachwissen im Bereich Anti Money Laundering, FATCA, CRS Investment Suitability und Crossborder / Interesse an der Innovation, am Wandel und am Change Management / Bereitschaft für ständige Weiterbildung und Entwicklung / Hohe Professionalität mit Kollegen auf verschiedenen Levels und Kulturen / Konzeptionelles, analytisches und kreatives Denkvermögen / Selbstständige und exakte Arbeitsweise / Gewandt im Auftreten und in der Kommunikation / Routiniert im Halten von Präsentationen vor dem Senior Management / Deutsch und Englisch.</p><p>Ihr Kontakt:</p><p>Herr Ivano Coni ist gerne für Sie da. Ihre Bewerbung wird streng vertraulich behandelt.</p><p></p><p>coni + partner ag</p><p>Ivano Coni</p><p>Managing Director</p><p>Klosbachstrasse 107</p><p>CH-8032 -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/conipartner-ag/senior-internal-auditor-front-office-compliance-crossborder-zurich-8384","tags":["Compliance","Security"],"job_types":["Unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag","berufserfahren"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792819831},{"slug":"value-engineer-zurich-442441","company_name":"celonis","title":"Value Engineer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/celonis/value-engineer-zurich-442441","tags":["Value Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792810523},{"slug":"recruiting-hr-operations-manager-nyon-483144","company_name":"Eh Group","title":"Recruiting & HR Operations Manager","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a hands-on, resourceful Recruiting &amp; HR Operations Manager to help us attract, hire, and support exceptional talent as we grow. This role will primarily focus on full-cycle recruiting, partnering closely with hiring managers and leadership to understand business needs, build talent pipelines, and deliver an efficient, high-quality candidate experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">While recruiting will be the priority, this role will support onboarding, employee lifecycle administration, and day-to-day HR operations for our Swiss-based team when time allows. Reporting to the Fractional HR leader based in the US, you will help build scalable, consistent people practices while providing responsive support to employees and managers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is an individual contributor role for someone who enjoys quick execution to make an impact, owning the details, building relationships, and balancing multiple priorities in a growing organization.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Talent Acquisition</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage full-cycle recruiting for positions across the organization, from intake meetings and sourcing through interviews, offers, and closing candidates.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with hiring managers to define role requirements, develop recruiting strategies, and establish clear selection criteria.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Source candidates through LinkedIn, professional networks, referrals, and other creative channels.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain strong talent pipelines for current and anticipated hiring needs.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate interview processes, ensuring timely communication, structured evaluations, and a positive candidate experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage offer processes, including compensation coordination, offer approvals, and preparation of employment contracts in partnership with HR and leadership.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track recruiting metrics, pipeline health, time-to-fill, and other key indicators to identify opportunities to improve hiring effectiveness.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain accurate applicant tracking system records and recruiting documentation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the development of consistent recruiting practices across locations while accounting for local market expectations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>HR Operations</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate preboarding and onboarding activities, including background checks, system entry, equipment, relocation coordination, and orientation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with hiring managers and cross-functional teams to ensure new employees have a smooth, engaging start.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support new-hire check-ins and identify opportunities to improve the onboarding experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support employee lifecycle processes, including new hires, employment changes, internal transfers, and departures.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist with HR reporting, audits, and other operational projects as needed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate with external payroll providers, benefits partners, and local HR or employment advisors as needed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support compliance with applicable Swiss employment requirements and internal policies in partnership with the Fractional HR leader and relevant local experts.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Collaboration &amp; Continuous Improvement</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with the Fractional HR leader to prioritize recruiting and people initiatives aligned with business objectives.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build trusted relationships with employees, hiring managers, and cross-functional partners.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Handle confidential employee and candidate information with discretion and sound judgment.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the development of consistent, scalable HR processes in a growing organization while recognizing the need for locally appropriate practices.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Desired Skills and Experience</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">4+ years of experience in full-cycle recruiting, talent acquisition, and/or HR operations, ideally in a growing technology, energy, engineering, or other technical organization.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated success managing multiple open requisitions and delivering a strong candidate experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience recruiting for technical, commercial, operational, or corporate roles; experience in engineering or energy-related hiring is a plus.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Swiss employment practices and HR administration, or experience supporting employees in Switzerland.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English; professional proficiency in French is strongly preferred given the location in Nyon and the potential need to support local employees and external partners.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with applicant tracking systems (Ashby preferred), HRIS platforms (HiBob), and standard productivity tools.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong organizational skills and attention to detail, with the ability to manage competing priorities independently.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent interpersonal, written, and verbal communication skills.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive, solutions-oriented approach and willingness to roll up your sleeves to get things done.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to handle sensitive information with discretion and maintain confidentiality.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/eh-group/recruiting-hr-operations-manager-nyon-483144","tags":["HR"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Nyon","created_at":1792798811},{"slug":"technicienne-stack-nyon-468759","company_name":"Eh Group","title":"Technicien(ne) Stack","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>À propos d'EH Energy Engineering</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">EH Energy réinvente la pile à combustible pour la mobilité poids lourd et l'énergie stationnaire à grande échelle. Plus compacte, plus puissante, moins coûteuse à produire : notre technologie répond aux défis énergétiques et environnementaux d'aujourd'hui.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rejoignez une équipe qui innove pour répondre à une demande énergétique croissante et bâtir un avenir plus propre. Nous cherchons des Techniciens Stack pour assembler, tester et soutenir le développement de nos piles à combustible. (2 postes à pourvoir)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Responsabilités principales :</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assembler des piles à combustible et leurs sous-ensembles selon les instructions de travail et les normes de qualité</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manipuler et préparer les membranes, AME (assemblages membrane-électrodes), plaques bipolaires, joints et plaques d'extrémité</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Utiliser les outillages d'assemblage, presses et équipements de test d'étanchéité/pression</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribuer à la fabrication de prototypes et de stacks de pré-série, en collaboration avec l'ingénierie</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enregistrer les données de fabrication, effectuer les contrôles qualité en cours de production et signaler les non-conformités</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintenir l'atelier et la salle blanche propres, sûrs et bien organisés</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Participer à l'amélioration continue des processus d'assemblage et des montages</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compétences et expérience requises :</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apprentissage technique (CFC) ou diplôme dans un domaine mécanique, électromécanique ou connexe</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3 à 4 ans d'expérience en assemblage de précision, idéalement dans les piles à combustible, batteries, électronique ou automobile</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">À l'aise avec les outils manuels, les outils de couple et les équipements de mesure de base</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Minutieux(se), habile et soucieux(se) de la qualité, avec un grand sens du détail</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Capable de lire des plans techniques et des instructions de travail</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Esprit d'équipe et capacité à travailler de manière autonome</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bon niveau d'anglais ou de français obligatoire (oral et écrit) ; l'allemand est un atout</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une expérience en salle blanche ou en environnement contrôlé est un atout</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Date de début : Immédiate</strong></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/eh-group/technicienne-stack-nyon-468759","tags":["Production"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Nyon","created_at":1792798811},{"slug":"blockchain-engineer-zug-291866","company_name":"Blockvora","title":"Blockchain Engineer","description":"<h2>The role</h2><p>We are hiring a Blockchain Engineer to design and implement smart contracts and chain integrations. You will work closely with backend and product teams to ship secure, production-ready on-chain systems. This is a hands-on role focused on correctness, gas efficiency, and operational safety.</p><h2>What you'll do</h2><ul><li><p>Design and implement smart contracts</p></li><li><p>Integrate on-chain systems with backend and frontend services</p></li><li><p>Write tests, deployment scripts, and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p>Review contract security and operational risks</p></li><li><p>Support indexing, events, and transaction monitoring</p></li><li><p>Collaborate on token, custody, and market flows</p></li></ul><h2>What we're looking for</h2><p>Must-have experience and skills for this role.</p><ul><li><p>3+ years of software engineering experience</p></li><li><p>Strong Solidity or equivalent smart contract experience</p></li><li><p>Understanding of EVM fundamentals and common patterns</p></li><li><p>Experience with Hardhat / Foundry (or similar)</p></li><li><p>Ability to reason about security and edge cases</p></li><li><p>Comfort collaborating with backend and product teams</p></li></ul><h2>Nice to have</h2><ul><li><p>Audit experience or formal verification exposure</p></li><li><p>L2 networks (Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism)</p></li><li><p>ethers.js / web3.js integrations</p></li><li><p>RWA, DeFi, or fintech product experience</p></li></ul><h2>Tech stack</h2><p>Solidity</p><p>Hardhat / Foundry</p><p>Ethereum · L2s</p><p>ethers.js</p><p>Node.js</p><p>PostgreSQL</p><h2>Why join</h2><ul><li><p>Work on modern Web3, RWA, and digital products</p></li><li><p>High ownership and visible product impact</p></li><li><p>Close collaboration with engineering, product, and design</p></li><li><p>Fast-paced environment with real production systems</p></li><li><p>Remote-friendly across global time zones</p></li></ul><h2>Hiring process</h2><ul><li><p>Application review</p></li><li><p>Technical interview</p></li><li><p>Final discussion</p></li></ul><h2>How to apply</h2><p>We review every relevant profile. Keep it concise and concrete.</p><p>Resume or LinkedIn</p><p>GitHub profile or portfolio (preferred)</p><p>Examples of relevant work you're proud of</p><p>Apply with the button on this page.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/blockvora/blockchain-engineer-zug-291866","tags":["Remote","Software Development"],"job_types":["Permanent employment","professional / experienced"],"location":"Zug","created_at":1792782048},{"slug":"backend-engineer-zug-145470","company_name":"Blockvora","title":"Backend Engineer","description":"<h2>The role</h2><p>We are hiring a Backend Engineer to design, build, and maintain scalable backend services. You will own APIs, data models, and integrations with blockchain and third-party systems. Stack is not limited to Node — strong engineers in Rust, Go, Java, Python, or Ruby are welcome. This is a hands-on role focused on reliability, security, and production readiness.</p><h2>What you'll do</h2><p>Build and maintain backend services in one or more of: Node.js, Rust, Go, Java, Python, Ruby</p><p>Design REST and/or GraphQL APIs</p><p>Model data and own PostgreSQL / Redis (or equivalent) usage</p><p>Integrate blockchain APIs, wallets, and external services</p><p>Implement auth, permissions, and operational controls</p><p>Write tests, improve observability, and participate in reviews</p><p>Ship production-ready services with CI/CD</p><h2>What we're looking for</h2><p>Must-have experience and skills for this role.</p><p>3+ years of backend engineering experience</p><p>Strong proficiency in at least one of: Node.js/TypeScript, Rust, Go, Java, Python, or Ruby</p><p>Experience with relational databases (PostgreSQL preferred) and caching</p><p>Solid understanding of REST APIs and system design basics</p><p>Experience integrating external APIs or microservices</p><p>Strong coding fundamentals and production debugging skills</p><h2>Nice to have</h2><p>Proficiency across multiple backend languages</p><p>Web3 integrations (ethers.js, smart contract APIs, chain clients)</p><p>Event-driven or distributed systems experience</p><p>AWS / GCP familiarity</p><p>Fintech or consulting experience</p><h2>Tech stack</h2><p>Node.js · TypeScript</p><p>Rust</p><p>Go</p><p>Java</p><p>Python</p><p>Ruby</p><p>PostgreSQL · Redis</p><p>Docker · AWS / GCP</p><h2>Why join</h2><p>Work on modern Web3, RWA, and digital products</p><p>High ownership and visible product impact</p><p>Close collaboration with engineering, product, and design</p><p>Fast-paced environment with real production systems</p><p>Remote-friendly across global time zones</p><h2>What success looks like</h2><p>Stable APIs in production</p><p>Clear data models and service boundaries</p><p>Reliable integrations with blockchain and third-party systems</p><p>Low operational noise and strong code quality</p><h2>Hiring process</h2><p>Application review</p><p>Technical discussion (backend + system design)</p><p>Final discussion</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/blockvora/backend-engineer-zug-145470","tags":["Remote","Software Development"],"job_types":["Permanent employment","professional / experienced"],"location":"Zug","created_at":1792778451},{"slug":"b2b-sales-managerin-dach-markt-homeoffice-50-freelance-zurich-157831","company_name":"aeroTELEGRAPH","title":"B2B Sales Manager:in – DACH-Markt (Homeoffice, 50 %) – Freelance","description":"<h2>Über aeroTELEGRAPH</h2><p>aeroTELEGRAPH ist das führende Luftfahrtportal im deutschsprachigen Raum und versorgt die Branche sowie interessierte Leser mit tagesaktuellen, verständlichen und fundierten Berichten rund um die zivile Luftfahrt.</p><h2>Ihre Aufgaben im Vertrieb</h2><p>In dieser Rolle verantworten Sie den B2B-Vertrieb im DACH-Markt auf freiberuflicher Basis bei einer wöchentlichen Arbeitszeit von 20 Stunden. Sie gewinnen neue Geschäftskunden, pflegen bestehende Partnerschaften und bauen unsere Marktpräsenz im Bereich der Luftfahrtmedien weiter aus.</p><h2>Das bringen Sie mit</h2><ul><li><p>Erfahrung im B2B-Vertrieb</p></li><li><p>Kenntnisse im Medienumfeld oder der Luftfahrtbranche von Vorteil</p></li><li><p>Selbstständige und zielorientierte Arbeitsweise</p></li><li><p>Verhandlungssichere Deutschkenntnisse</p></li></ul><h2>Ihre ersten Monate</h2><p>Sie nehmen bestehende Vertriebsprozesse auf, knüpfen erste Kontakte zu potenziellen Geschäftskunden im DACH-Markt und bauen Ihr Netzwerk im Bereich der Luftfahrtmedien kontinuierlich aus.</p><h2>Arbeitsumfeld</h2><p>Die Tätigkeit erfolgt im Homeoffice.</p><h2>Ihr Start</h2><p>Sollten Sie nicht alle Anforderungen voll erfüllen, freuen wir uns dennoch über Ihre Bewerbung. Die Zusammenarbeit ist auf 20 Stunden pro Woche ausgelegt und bietet Ihnen die Flexibilität des Arbeitens im Homeoffice.</p><p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/aerotelegraph/b2b-sales-managerin-dach-markt-homeoffice-50-freelance-zurich-157831","tags":["Remote","Management","Team Leader"],"job_types":["Unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag","teamleitung"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792771266},{"slug":"senior-consultant-business-analyst-customer-crm-in-financial-services-4842","company_name":"capco","title":"(Senior) Consultant / Business Analyst – Customer & CRM in Financial Services (m/w/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;DIE ROLLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Für unsere Kunden aus dem Banken- und Versicherungsumfeld suchen wir eine:n erfahrene:n (Senior) Consultant / Business Analyst mit Fokus auf Kundenprozesse und CRM. Du gestaltest gemeinsam mit Fachbereichen, IT und Projektteams, wie Finanzinstitute ihre Kundinnen und Kunden über den gesamten Lebenszyklus betreuen: vom Onboarding über die laufende Kundenbeziehung bis zum Offboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du arbeitest an der Schnittstelle von Business, Technologie und Daten. Du analysierst bestehende Prozesse und Systeme, übersetzt fachliche Anforderungen in klare Spezifikationen und begleitest die Umsetzung in CRM- und Client-Lifecycle-Management-Lösungen. Dabei denkst du dich schnell in neue Themen und Kundenorganisationen ein und bringst Projekte proaktiv voran.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEIN CAPCO-ALLTAG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Du analysierst Kundenprozesse entlang des Client Lifecycle, z. B. Onboarding, KYC, Stammdatenpflege, Kundenbetreuung und Offboarding, und identifizierst Verbesserungs- und Automatisierungspotenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
