 and an incubator for our product portfolio. We build device-level alternatives to centralized cloud and trust. Our strategy is to grow our foundational decentralized network by building high-demand enterprise products directly on top of it.</p><p>Your portfolio includes:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Acurast:</strong> Decentralized confidential compute running on ordinary smartphones.</p></li><li><p><strong>Obsidio:</strong> A continuous, AI-assisted pentesting subscription. Incubated by Papers, Obsidio is built directly on Acurast, leveraging the decentralized network as a unique compute moat to battle-test networks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hypergate:</strong> Enterprise mobile single sign-on for managed Android and iOS fleets.</p></li></ul><p>As an engineering-driven team, we work with autonomy and purpose. Our culture is built on meritocracy, long-term thinking, and a commitment to quality over buzz, innovation is in our DNA. We aim to collaborate with people who love tech for its own sake and want to help shape the future by solving real-world challenges.</p><p></p><h2>Your role</h2><p>We are seeking a tech-savvy, execution-oriented <strong>Growth & AI Marketing Operations Specialist</strong> to serve as the engine powering our growth campaigns, content infrastructure, and data analytics pipeline.</p><p>Your main goal will be to communicate our stories across a portfolio of brands by bridging the gap between cutting-edge AI, data operations, and tactical growth marketing. You’ll be building automated content workflows, ensuring the highest quality across everything we generate, running multi-channel campaigns from start to finish, and maintaining rock-solid attribution tracking.</p><p>If you are obsessed with efficiency, operational speed, and using AI to scale output without ever sacrificing quality and if you thrive when given a blank slate to write your own playbook, this role is for you.</p><h2><strong>Success Metrics (First 90 Days)</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>