version through the relevant funnel.</p></li><li><p><strong>Rapid A/B & Multivariate Testing:</strong> Design, set up, and evaluate rapid growth experiments (copy variants, landing page layouts, audience segmentation, offer positioning) on a weekly sprint cycle.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>3. AI Pipeline Operation & Content QA</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Automated Workflow Orchestration:</strong> Build, maintain, and optimize AI-driven content pipelines to generate high-quality marketing assets at scale.</p></li><li><p><strong>Human-in-the-Loop Quality Assurance:</strong> Establish strict QA processes to review, refine, and approve AI-generated copy, visual assets, landing page content, and email sequences before deployment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prompt Engineering & Template Optimization:</strong> Continuously iterate on, standardize, and version-control skills, design systems and context workflows to ensure output matches brand voice, compliance standards, and conversion best practices.</p></li><li><p><strong>Scale & Efficiency Metrics:</strong> Track content throughput, error rates, and time-to-market reduction, driving continuous improvement in pipeline efficiency.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>4. Analytics, Attribution & Data Ops</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Tracking Infrastructure:</strong> Implementation and maintenance of event tracking, pixel setups, UTM parameters, and server-side tracking across all digital properties.</p></li><li><p><strong>Attribution Modeling:</strong> Own multi-touch attribution models to accurately trace pipeline generation, conversions, and revenue back to specific campaigns, channels, and AI-driven experiments.</p></li><li><p><strong>Data Integrity & Governance:</strong> Regularly audit marketing data across CRMs, marketing automation platforms, and internal databases to clean anomalies and maintain a single source of truth.</p></li><li><p><strong>Performance Reporting:</strong> Build and manage real-time dashboards providing actio