xperience, or academic record.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive mindset with the ability to drive results independently, and a talent for keeping track of multiple tasks in parallel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have gained first experience in top-tier consulting, venture capital, startups, or another fast-paced or relevant environment, and remain flexible in your approach to tasks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are curious about GenAI and eager to use it to work smarter. No coding background needed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good English and advanced Dutch language skills. German is a plus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Why you should join bunch</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will join one of Europe’s fastest-growing fintech startups and help drive its rapid expansion.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work closely with our Country Manager on business-crucial topics in the Netherlands and Germany, from sales to operations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is set up to equip you with the skills to succeed in a full-time commercial role at bunch, a VC, or any other startup.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A paid, part-time working student position (3 days/week).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow and thrive in a fast-paced environment with a strong emphasis on learning and personal development.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A friendly, human-centered culture that we live by every day, focused on personal growth, empowering others, and valuing unique perspectives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A lovely office located in the heart of vibrant Amsterdam.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>